---
description: Limit on submit attempts when applying to a job
alwaysApply: true
---

When submitting a job application (any ATS, any tool), make at most 3 submit attempts per job.

- An attempt is one click of the final Submit/Apply button.
- Entering an emailed security code in the same still-open form is part of that attempt, not a new one.
- If the third attempt doesn't reach a confirmation page, stop and log the job as
  `needs_manual_review` with the reason. Don't try a fourth time, even if a fix looks obvious.
- Never try to get around a CAPTCHA to make an attempt succeed.
